                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="12907381" author="jyoung" created="Wed, 8 Sep 2010 19:48:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Are you planning on creating the integer array once, by adding int[] cardinality to AbstractMatrix, or did you have another solution in mind?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="12907389" author="tdunning" created="Wed, 8 Sep 2010 20:00:13 +0000"  >
&lt;p&gt;I just committed a change that allocates once, adding cardinality to AM and adding rowSize() and columnSize() to Matrix pretty much in &lt;br/&gt;
line with what you suggest.  That the code was ever otherwise was just something that I wouldn&apos;t have believed until a profiler stuffed&lt;br/&gt;
it into my face.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="12907390" author="tdunning" created="Wed, 8 Sep 2010 20:00:37 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Committed a pretty simple fix.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="12907450" author="hudson" created="Wed, 8 Sep 2010 21:55:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Integrated in Mahout-Quality #263 (See &lt;a href=&quot;https://hudson.apache.org/hudson/job/Mahout-Quality/263/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://hudson.apache.org/hudson/job/Mahout-Quality/263/&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
</comment>
